"r-caption">Prepared benefits — not activated. The allowance, fee and membership terms will be confirmed before enrolment.</p></div></div></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>An early prototype experience</h2></div><p>The planned first-100-member benefit is priority booking to try a 3D-printed prototype of the member’s own charm. Eligibility, materials, making and delivery costs must be confirmed first; it is not a promise of a free finished jewel.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Clear terms before you join</h2></div><p>No membership checkout, automatic renewal, generation credits or registration discount is active in this preview. Ordinary design enquiries remain available by email.</p><a class="r-link" href="/en/pages/contact">Ask us about co-creation<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section></div>
